# MConnect Start Demo - VHS Tape
# Generate with: vhs demos/mconnect-start.tape

Output demos/gifs/mconnect-start.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

# Title
Type "# MConnect - Control AI Agents from Your Phone"
Enter
Sleep 1s

# Install and start
Type "npx lecoder-mconnect start"
Enter
Sleep 5s

# Show the session starting
Sleep 3s

# Highlight key features
Type "# ✓ Secure Cloudflare Tunnel"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "# ✓ QR Code for Mobile Connection"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "# ✓ Multi-Agent Tmux Sessions"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "# ✓ Opik Observability Traces"
Enter
Sleep 2s
